line 118 extra: by-design spec §1.6 `&&` keeps `number` and `boolean` whole in its falsy part, where tsc narrows to `0` or `false`; also by-design spec §1.6 `a && b` is `falsy_part(a) | b`, even when `a`'s truthiness is known
